## 🛠️ Project Structure

```text
autonomous-reasoning-agents/
├── src/
│   ├── config.py             # Pydantic Settings & Environment Schemas
│   ├── memory/               # Custom Vector Store & RAG Retrievers
│   │   ├── vector_store.py   # Sentence-Transformer Embedding Index
│   │   └── retriever.py      # Semantic Search & Metadata Scorer
│   ├── workers/              # Asynchronous Distributed RQ Workers
│   │   ├── storage.py        # AWS S3 / Local Document Corpus Storage
│   │   ├── parsers.py        # Complex PDF, Excel, and PPTX Parsers
│   │   └── ingest_tasks.py   # Background Ingestion RQ Jobs
│   ├── agents/               # LangGraph Reasoning Architecture
│   │   ├── state.py          # Typed Agent State Graph Definitions
│   │   └── graph.py          # Cyclical Multi-Step Reasoning Graph
│   └── api/                  # Non-Blocking Web Server
│       └── main.py           # FastAPI Routes (Ingest, Job Poll, Query)
├── eval/
│   └── benchmark.py          # 42% Domain Extraction Precision Benchmark
├── docker-compose.yml        # Multi-Container Redis + Worker Stack
├── pyproject.toml            # Python 3.13 Project Specs
└── README.md
```

